Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:17.18,0:06:17.68,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}不知道
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:21.05,0:06:21.47,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}是吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:22.19,0:06:23.10,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}你就是为了问这件事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:23.11,0:06:24.99,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}所以从白天开始就一直盯着我看吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:25.94,0:06:26.46,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}嗯
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:27.47,0:06:29.92,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}啊，今天扫除的时候
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:30.57,0:06:31.77,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}你是在拧抹布的吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:32.32,0:06:34.64,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}总觉得跟我妈妈似的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:35.46,0:06:36.08,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}妈妈
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:36.94,0:06:37.28,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}嗯
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:39.47,0:06:40.03,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}总觉得
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:41.08,0:06:43.39,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}感觉拧抹布时的动作很像我妈妈
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:44.52,0:06:47.68,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}说不定绫波你很适合当家庭主妇呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:51.70,0:06:52.56,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}你在胡说什么啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:54.81,0:06:58.95,TV,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(50,50)}[TV]你说什么！那时候不就是你提出要分手的嘛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:00.22,0:07:03.20,TV,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(50,50)}[TV]那时是我一时糊涂
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:03.62,0:07:04.93,TV,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(50,50)}[TV]你现在怎么这么说
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:05.80,0:07:09.28,TV,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(50,50)}[TV]我不知道你怎么样，但我比以前改变了很多啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:09.76,0:07:12.02,TV,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(50,50)}[TV]只是我对你的感觉一直没变
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:12.03,0:07:15.16,TV,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(50,50)}[TV]时针和人一样，都是不能回到起点重来的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:15.74,0:07:17.80,TV,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(50,50)}[TV]我也一样已经不可能回到那个时候了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:18.05,0:07:19.80,TV,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(50,50)}[TV]但是我还是喜欢你——
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:19.90,0:07:21.90,TV,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(50,50)}[TV]我都说了我们是不可能的了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:22.28,0:07:25.28,TV,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(50,50)}[TV]我为了忘记你足足用了3年的时间
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:25.29,0:07:27.50,TV,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(50,50)}[TV]现在什么都不要说了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:57.62,0:06:58.51,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}我回来了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:59.04,0:07:00.10,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}欢迎回来
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:00.56,0:07:03.52,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}还不去睡觉吗？明天你不是有约会吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:03.88,0:07:05.13,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}是啊，跟一个大帅哥
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:06.23,0:07:07.60,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}啊，对了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:07.98,0:07:09.81,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}那个借我，熏衣草香水
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:10.34,0:07:10.71,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}不行
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:11.33,0:07:12.85,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}哼！小气
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:13.28,0:07:14.99,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}那不是小孩子擦的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:15.50,0:07:16.42,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}真嗣在房间里吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:16.65,0:07:17.77,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}一直关在里面
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:18.32,0:07:19.97,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}看来他是不愿意去见他爸爸嘛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:20.35,0:07:22.08,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}不想见面的话，直说好了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:22.14,0:07:23.78,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}日本人真是…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:24.34,0:07:26.12,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}他也不是真的不愿意
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:27.08,0:07:28.51,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}这才是问题所在
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:34.43,0:07:34.90,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}滚回去
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:39.76,0:07:41.79,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}你做得很好，真嗣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:45.29,0:07:47.86,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}真嗣君，我要开门罗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:52.58,0:07:55.45,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}害怕吗？怕跟你父亲单独见面
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:57.41,0:07:58.70,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}不可以老是逃避
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:59.31,0:08:00.93,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}自己不主动跨出第一步的话
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:01.15,0:08:02.12,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}什么也不会改变的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:02.96,0:08:04.36,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}我知道了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:05.38,0:08:06.54,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}从现在起就该好好想想
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:07.08,0:08:08.49,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}不只是最初的开始
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:09.04,0:08:11.58,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}之后的事情也很重要
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:12.36,0:08:15.02,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}总之，你明天去时要挺起胸膛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:15.60,0:08:16.64,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}因为你也要见你妈妈啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:17.85,0:08:18.86,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}那么，晚安了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:25.26,0:08:27.46,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}你买了明天穿的衣服对吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:27.60,0:08:28.28,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}让我看看嘛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:28.30,0:08:30.53,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}你想看？很贵的喔
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:30.54,0:08:32.07,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}品味比价格更重要
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:32.20,0:08:33.95,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}这你就不用担心了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:34.34,0:08:37.30,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}果然…是为了迎合加持先生的喜好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:37.77,0:08:38.56,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}哪有可能
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:38.84,0:08:39.30,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}早就没那事儿了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:41.51,0:08:41.97,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}那么
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:42.02,0:08:42.48,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}出发吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:42.57,0:08:43.33,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}走了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:49.82,0:08:51.91,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}将三个袋子置于内心…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:49.82,0:08:54.60,BGS,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}{\fad(50,50)}*人生中有三个重要的袋：胃(胃袋)、容忍(堪忍袋)、妈妈(お袋)
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:52.08,0:08:54.60,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}红色、蓝色、黄色的…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:55.28,0:08:57.37,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}啊，各位请自便
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:57.40,0:08:58.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,【加持良治先生】
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:00.08,0:09:01.09,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}小良没有来呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:01.63,0:09:05.06,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}那个笨蛋从来没有一次准时过的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:05.52,0:09:06.76,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}那是约会的时候吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:06.96,0:09:08.19,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}工作时可就不一样了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:08.74,0:09:09.66,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}哎呀，两位小姐
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:10.20,0:09:11.79,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}今天比平常更加美丽耶
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:12.62,0:09:14.58,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}工作很忙，现在都还是分不开身啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:14.83,0:09:17.20,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}明明平常四处闲逛总是很闲的样子
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:18.12,0:09:19.08,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}其它就算了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:19.09,0:09:20.98,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}但你那那脸胡渣不能想办法处理一下吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:21.32,0:09:22.84,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}你看，领带都歪了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:22.13,0:09:23.13,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}哦，果然
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:23.76,0:09:25.22,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}真是谢谢你了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:25.57,0:09:26.91,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}看起来很像夫妻哦，你们两个
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:27.86,0:09:29.15,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}你说得太对了，小律
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:29.63,0:09:30.67,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}谁会跟这种家伙像夫妇啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:45.92,0:09:47.05,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}相隔 3 年了吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:47.06,0:09:48.75,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}离我们上次一起到这里来
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:49.60,0:09:51.98,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}我那时候逃了出去
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:52.95,0:09:54.15,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}之后就再没来过
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:54.98,0:09:56.63,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}当时我不能明白为何妈妈长眠于此
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:57.59,0:10:00.78,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}…现在却连面容也记不清了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:01.06,0:10:03.67,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}人类必须忘记回忆才能活下去
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:04.15,0:10:06.44,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}但是有些事则是绝对不能忘的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:07.27,0:10:09.84,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}唯让我知道了那个无可取代的事物
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:10.67,0:10:13.25,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}我就是为了确认这件事而来到这里
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:15.85,0:10:17.00,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}没有照片之类的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:17.41,0:10:18.22,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}我没有留
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:18.86,0:10:20.36,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}这个墓地也只是装饰品而已
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:20.97,0:10:21.65,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}里面没有遗体
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:21.90,0:10:23.32,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}跟老师说的一样
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:23.75,0:10:25.01,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}你把一切都舍弃了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:25.98,0:10:27.55,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}一切都存在于内心中
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:28.03,0:10:28.96,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}现在只要这样就够了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:32.47,0:10:34.24,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}时间到了，我先回去了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:42.17,0:10:42.70,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}爸爸
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:44.96,0:10:45.29,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}那个…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:46.21,0:10:47.65,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}我今天很高兴
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:48.38,0:10:49.35,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}可以跟爸爸说话
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:50.32,0:10:50.80,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}是吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:36.21,0:11:39.16,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}拉得不错嘛，你还有这手啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:40.02,0:11:42.77,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}从 5 岁开始拉，到现在才有这种程度
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:43.46,0:11:44.90,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}也算不上有什么天赋
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:45.11,0:11:47.84,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}贵在坚持啊，我对你有点刮目相看了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:48.31,0:11:51.96,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}是老师叫我学的，其实放弃也无所谓
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:52.17,0:11:53.88,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}那你干吗还一直练到现在啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:54.76,0:11:56.55,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}又没人叫我停呀
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:56.85,0:11:58.11,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}果然哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:59.01,0:11:59.99,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}这么早就回来了啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:00.75,0:12:02.32,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}还以为你要吃了晚饭再回来呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:02.71,0:12:04.45,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}是那男生太无聊了嘛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:04.81,0:12:08.41,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}所以就趁等云霄飞车的时候溜回来了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:04.81,0:12:08.41,BGS,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}{\fad(50,50)}*云霄飞车（jet coaster）：一种飞行游戏
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:09.37,0:12:10.79,CNBody,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}也不用这么绝吧
